    "text": "MLB'We'll be the hunted': North Jersey's Mark DeRosa sets the tone as Team USA manager in WBC3 minute read Pete CalderaMLB WriterUpdated March 2, 2023, 2:51 p.m. ETTAMPA, Fla. – A collection of players arrives in Arizona this weekend, exiting major league camps to form Team USA, and their manager can’t wait to get started.“I want there to be a buzz,’’ Mark DeRosa says of setting a tone for the World Baseball Classic.The 20-team tournament opens Wednesday, March 8, with the final on March 21 at Miami, and “I want these guys to enjoy the heck out of this experience.’’",
